          "text": "Description: A witness observed in the sky on February 27, 2009, around 8:48 PM, the silent movements of two red lights circling and then moving away towards the South. The witness will report another observation made on August 15, 2009. The observation described by the witness is fully consistent with the appearance of two military aircraft flying in formation. This case is classified as B, indicating a probable observation of a military aircraft patrol.",
